[
 {
  "id": "s1",
  "name": "内存 = 工作台",
  "beats": [
   {
    "text": "把电脑的内存，想象成一张工作台。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s1_0.wav",
    "dur": 4.424,
    "lead": 0.5
   },
   {
    "text": "你写程序产生的变量、下载的数据，就是台子上的食材、锅碗瓢盆，还有切剩下的菜叶子。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s1_1.wav",
    "dur": 9.049,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "那什么是垃圾？切完洋葱留下的葱皮，用完不再碰的空碗。台子堆满了，新菜没地方放，电脑就会内存溢出，OOM，直接卡死。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s1_2.wav",
    "dur": 12.206,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "懂了这一点，你就能看懂 GC 到底是什么，以及为什么 Rust 在性能上，能把 Go 甩开一大截。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s1_3.wav",
    "dur": 9.776,
    "lead": 0
   }
  ],
  "dur": 35.455
 },
 {
  "id": "s2",
  "name": "Go：厨师 + 保洁阿姨",
  "beats": [
   {
    "text": "先看 Go。Go 像一个，配了专属保洁阿姨的厨师。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s2_0.wav",
    "dur": 5.238,
    "lead": 0.5
   },
   {
    "text": "厨师只管炒菜，切完萝卜皮随手一扔，煎完蛋的锅往旁边一推，立刻去炒下一道。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s2_1.wav",
    "dur": 8.261,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "保洁阿姨，也就是 GC 垃圾回收器，在后台不停巡视。这个萝卜皮还要吗？不要了，扔掉。这盘牛肉还连着炒锅吗？还在用，留着。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s2_2.wav",
    "dur": 13.526,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "但阿姨不是免费的，有三个代价。第一，多占好几倍的地方。台子太小，阿姨来不及收，所以 Go 往往要申请，比实际用量大一点五到三倍的内存，当缓冲。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s2_3.wav",
    "dur": 14.842,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "第二，偷偷消耗体力。厨师只用了四成力气，阿姨翻垃圾、做标记、倒垃圾，也在悄悄吃掉二到三成的资源。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s2_4.wav",
    "dur": 10.859,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "第三，偶尔的暂停打扰。垃圾太多时，阿姨会拍一下厨师：先别动，停半毫秒，让我扫干净。对外卖没影响，但在高频交易、游戏物理引擎这种分秒必争的赛车维修站，这就是事故。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s2_5.wav",
    "dur": 18.553,
    "lead": 0
   }
  ],
  "dur": 71.279
 },
 {
  "id": "s3",
  "name": "Rust：机关弹簧 + 魔鬼教官",
  "beats": [
   {
    "text": "再看 Rust。Rust 根本不请阿姨，它的哲学是：垃圾根本就不应该落地。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s3_0.wav",
    "dur": 7.161,
    "lead": 0.5
   },
   {
    "text": "它的厨房里，每个锅碗瓢盆下面，都连着一套机关弹簧。变量一离开作用域，咔哒一声，暗门弹开，锅精准掉进洗碗槽，一微秒都不多停。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s3_1.wav",
    "dur": 13.806,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "这套机制靠谁保证？靠编译器，一个拿着皮鞭的魔鬼教官。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s3_2.wav",
    "dur": 5.756,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "第十二行你把菜刀借给了二厨，第十五行怎么又拿它切肉？沙拉已经端给客人，还想抓花生米？不行，回去重写。每件工具谁拿、用多久、何时归还，规划得严丝合缝，才准你点火。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s3_3.wav",
    "dur": 18.553,
    "lead": 0
   }
  ],
  "dur": 45.276
 },
 {
  "id": "s4",
  "name": "跑起来的差异",
  "beats": [
   {
    "text": "程序真正跑起来，差异就出来了。第一，零冗余。Rust 没有后台巡检，机器码直接在硬件上裸跑。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s4_0.wav",
    "dur": 10.004,
    "lead": 0.5
   },
   {
    "text": "第二，内存压榨。同一个任务，Go 可能要一个 G 的周转缓冲，Rust 算出需要三十兆，就只占三十兆。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s4_1.wav",
    "dur": 9.745,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "第三，绝对稳定。每块内存什么时候清理，编译时就刻死了，耗时是一条平滑的直线，没有阿姨突然叫停的卡顿。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s4_2.wav",
    "dur": 10.836,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "第四，直接操控硬件。内存对齐、SIMD 向量指令，伸手就能摸到发动机的齿轮。这也是 Linux 内核模块、浏览器内核、高频量化引擎，青睐 C、C++ 和 Rust 的原因。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s4_3.wav",
    "dur": 18.623,
    "lead": 0
   }
  ],
  "dur": 49.208
 },
 {
  "id": "s5",
  "name": "那 Go 为什么没被淘汰",
  "beats": [
   {
    "text": "那 Go 凭什么没被淘汰？因为雇阿姨虽然多花点电费，但厨师省心啊。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s5_0.wav",
    "dur": 6.982,
    "lead": 0.5
   },
   {
    "text": "写后台管理、微服务 API，网络信号在网线里跑一趟，就要几十毫秒。阿姨扫地用掉的零点五毫秒，根本没人在意。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s5_1.wav",
    "dur": 12.052,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "Go 让你不用去算，每口锅该掉进哪个暗门，脑子全用来赶工期，半天就能上线。而写 Rust，你要在编译器里，和魔鬼教官大战三天三夜。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s5_2.wav",
    "dur": 13.345,
    "lead": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "所以，Rust 的快和稳，是拿写代码时的痛苦换来的。选 Go 还是 Rust，看你的场景。",
    "wav": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-welby--claude-spares-spare-gPKDkg/ff28a989-d178-461f-aae6-66fc5eac562e/scratchpad/audio/s5_3.wav",
    "dur": 8.275,
    "lead": 0
   }
  ],
  "dur": 40.654
 }
]